(6343401, 938998, 69487, '<td valign="top">Since black was considered not a color by the description.  I think you took a huge risk with this.  Its a very lovely shot.  The only possible help it will get is the two shades of blue.  I am giving it a 5 because I don''t wish to hurt such a nice shot any more then I have to.  But I am not sure it really pushes into 2 colors.</td>', 'Since black was considered not a color by the description.  I think you took a huge risk with this.  Its a very lovely shot.  The only possible help it will get is the two shades of blue.  I am giving it a 5 because I don''t wish to hurt such a nice shot any more then I have to.  But I am not sure it really pushes into 2 colors.', '2011-03-07 04:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343402, 939467, 69487, '<td valign="top">Even without the title a survey of the area does turn up brown and green.  It qualifies if anything!</td>', 'Even without the title a survey of the area does turn up brown and green.  It qualifies if anything!', '2011-03-07 04:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
