(6343440, 939529, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sentiments aside I can''t say I like the image. It is actually uncomfortable to look at, as the natural inclination is to read it, but it is distorted and blurry and the double vision effect doesn''t help.</td>', 'Sentiments aside I can''t say I like the image. It is actually uncomfortable to look at, as the natural inclination is to read it, but it is distorted and blurry and the double vision effect doesn''t help.', '2011-03-07 05:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
