(6343458, 938893, 88718, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I have the impression that the overall sharpness is lacking though.</td>', 'Great subject. I have the impression that the overall sharpness is lacking though.', '2011-03-07 05:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
