(6343542, 939448, 113156, '<td valign="top">I like this, it could have maybe been better if there was some volume under the shirt, but its still good. There is definitely something phallic about a tie.</td>', 'I like this, it could have maybe been better if there was some volume under the shirt, but its still good. There is definitely something phallic about a tie.', '2011-03-07 07:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343553, 939150, 113156, '<td valign="top">nice ambiance and very Soothing, it speaks to me more than most.</td>', 'nice ambiance and very Soothing, it speaks to me more than most.', '2011-03-07 07:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343558, 939445, 113156, '<td valign="top">Very sober, lovely texture &amp; shadows.</td>', 'Very sober, lovely texture & shadows.', '2011-03-07 07:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343562, 939527, 113156, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you did this but i''m liking the result, very artsy.</td>', 'Don''t know how you did this but i''m liking the result, very artsy.', '2011-03-07 07:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343593, 939461, 10785, '<td valign="top">These colors are very complimentary. Nice choice with that aspect. The colors may be truly represented but the whole photo lacks luminosity. The light is rather dull. I like how there are a few mediums tucked into the middle of all the extra larges. It adds a bit of humor.</td>', 'These colors are very complimentary. Nice choice with that aspect. The colors may be truly represented but the whole photo lacks luminosity. The light is rather dull. I like how there are a few mediums tucked into the middle of all the extra larges. It adds a bit of humor.', '2011-03-07 08:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343596, 939226, 10785, '<td valign="top">Sorta looks like severe camera shake is happening. Not only is the glass out of focus, the mid line between the two backgrounds has a dithered effect as if the camera has moved slightly. I think for this type of photo to work effectively and create to create that wow factor, it has to be tack sharp and in extreme focus.</td>', 'Sorta looks like severe camera shake is happening. Not only is the glass out of focus, the mid line between the two backgrounds has a dithered effect as if the camera has moved slightly. I think for this type of photo to work effectively and create to create that wow factor, it has to be tack sharp and in extreme focus.', '2011-03-07 08:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343599, 939351, 10785, '<td valign="top">A straight line of berries would have worked also. The tail or curve doesn''t seem to be leading me anywhere. Nice shadow and light, good color. Neat idea.</td>', 'A straight line of berries would have worked also. The tail or curve doesn''t seem to be leading me anywhere. Nice shadow and light, good color. Neat idea.', '2011-03-07 08:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343602, 939263, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great commercial photography. Put an ad line in there and you have something good enough for a magazine spread!</td>', 'Great commercial photography. Put an ad line in there and you have something good enough for a magazine spread!', '2011-03-07 08:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343605, 939426, 10785, '<td valign="top">With the DoF, it does look like the orange pencil tip is casting a complimentary blue shadow, which is quite interesting. But I just have to question, did you study further to determine if a shallow DoF worked best here? Did you shoot with a small aperture to see what the difference was? At any rate, this is a very creative concept. (Was this a complimentary comment or a backhanded critique?? I meant what I said to be complimentary!!)</td>', 'With the DoF, it does look like the orange pencil tip is casting a complimentary blue shadow, which is quite interesting. But I just have to question, did you study further to determine if a shallow DoF worked best here? Did you shoot with a small aperture to see what the difference was? At any rate, this is a very creative concept. (Was this a complimentary comment or a backhanded critique?? I meant what I said to be complimentary!!)', '2011-03-07 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343606, 939444, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think it has a little too much contrast, but other than that, it is really great. The red and yellow really pop!</td>', 'I think it has a little too much contrast, but other than that, it is really great. The red and yellow really pop!', '2011-03-07 08:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6343608, 939523, 10785, '<td valign="top">The colors don''t really go together in a complimentary or a contrasting way.</td>', 'The colors don''t really go together in a complimentary or a contrasting way.', '2011-03-07 08:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
