(6352781, 939387, 115674, '<td valign="top">Always happy to support your shooting sessions, specially when they produce such a fantastic shot!<br/>I´m really lucky, get unexpected presents twice: the flower and than the picture! Couldn´t be better!<br/>Congratulations on the top 5! Love, F<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-16 03:44:30.</i></td>', 'Always happy to support your shooting sessions, specially when they produce such a fantastic shot!I´m really lucky, get unexpected presents twice: the flower and than the picture! Couldn´t be better!Congratulations on the top 5! Love, F', '2011-03-16 03:43:55.000000', '2011-03-16 03:44:30.000000', 0),
(6352877, 938970, 70828, '<td valign="top">Karen ... This is just DISGUSTINGLY good.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Karen ... This is just DISGUSTINGLY good. ', '2011-03-16 07:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353089, 939409, 33736, '<td valign="top">A truly beautiful and unique image - but, it was up against some other outstanding shots.  I think at least 20 entries could have been tied for the three ribbons!  All of you should be proud of your creations.<br/> <br/>I do have a question, however.  Was your copyright info added post-contest (because of it being available for printing)?  This was a first for me, and I''m just being curious.</td>', 'A truly beautiful and unique image - but, it was up against some other outstanding shots.  I think at least 20 entries could have been tied for the three ribbons!  All of you should be proud of your creations. I do have a question, however.  Was your copyright info added post-contest (because of it being available for printing)?  This was a first for me, and I''m just being curious.', '2011-03-16 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353093, 938917, 33736, '<td valign="top">Gosh, anyone complaining about wanting a "biggie" camera because ''all they have'' is a Rebel and a kit lens ought to take a look at this image!  Your entry is wonderful - apparently, a good eye ad a wonderfully creative imagination doesn''t need $2-4,000 worth of gear!  Well done.</td>', 'Gosh, anyone complaining about wanting a "biggie" camera because ''all they have'' is a Rebel and a kit lens ought to take a look at this image!  Your entry is wonderful - apparently, a good eye ad a wonderfully creative imagination doesn''t need $2-4,000 worth of gear!  Well done.', '2011-03-16 11:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353096, 939225, 33736, '<td valign="top">Funny and well-shot.</td>', 'Funny and well-shot.', '2011-03-16 11:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353099, 939273, 33736, '<td valign="top">Darned clever, and even if the lighting is a bit harsh (as suggested by another commentator), I''m surprised that this did surpass quite a few other entries!<br/> <br/>Btw, I keep thinking that pieces of the Jalepenos and the apples would be great tossed together in a salad.</td>', 'Darned clever, and even if the lighting is a bit harsh (as suggested by another commentator), I''m surprised that this did surpass quite a few other entries! Btw, I keep thinking that pieces of the Jalepenos and the apples would be great tossed together in a salad.', '2011-03-16 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353233, 939445, 121739, '<td valign="top">simple,clara y perfecta la luz  congratulaciones!!!</td>', 'simple,clara y perfecta la luz  congratulaciones!!!', '2011-03-16 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6354303, 939102, 76335, '<td valign="top">This clearly needs a fave.</td>', 'This clearly needs a fave.', '2011-03-17 07:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
