(6354682, 939152, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10! The detail here is great and the orange really jumps off the page. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Congrats on the top 10! The detail here is great and the orange really jumps off the page. One of my top picks.', '2011-03-17 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
